span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">62b7589c-3daf-4141-bbec-6c17b7f427d9</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:62b7589c-3daf-4141-bbec-6c17b7f427d9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:62b7589c-3daf-4141-bbec-6c17b7f427d9\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> to combine three of these to extract <a href=\"/wiki/Essence_of_Unicorn_Horn\" title=\"Essence of Unicorn Horn\">Essence of Unicorn Horn</a> \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Unicorn Horn Game File Images</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 130px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 128px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Unicorn_Horn_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Icon\"><picture><img alt=\"Low resolution UI icon. An ivory coloured ridged spiral horn.\" src=\"/w/images/4/48/Unicorn_Horn_Unfaded_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/Unicorn_Horn_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Icon</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 130px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 128px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Unicorn_Horn_Unfaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-descrip